## E2E Testing Patterns Report

Based on my analysis of the `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/packages/web-ui/` test infrastructure, here's a comprehensive guide to the testing patterns used:

### 1. **Test File Organization**

All E2E tests live in `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/` with the pattern `*.spec.ts`:

**Test Files Found:**
